[PrintTextModified Text:……ではみなさん、ここは１つ<br>大人しく諦めて大魔女様に殺されるというのは<br>いかがでしょう……！|#0206Trial04_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:こいつの意見を聞く方が間違っているな。|#0206Trial04_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Confused_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:でも……どうにかしないと<br>のあたちも死んじゃうんだよね？|#0206Trial04_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default,Eyes1_Angry_Closed1,ArmR3,ArmL8,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:……戦うためには、武器が必要ね。|#0206Trial04_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right ZoomLevel:4
