@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:では魔女に生きる権利はなかったのですか？|#0206Trial04_Yuki014| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:そうであれば、なぜあなたたち人間にだけ<br>他者を蹂躙する権利があったというのでしょう。|#0206Trial04_Yuki015| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:そんな理不尽には、<br>理不尽で対抗しなくてはいけません。|#0206Trial04_Yuki016| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:人間に……<br>多大なる理不尽な罰を与えなくてはいけないのです。|#0206Trial04_Yuki017| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

